      },
      {
        "text": "Being conservative or Republican does not preclude being pro-environment, pro-outdoors, or pro-public lands.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Shutting down natural resource industries leads to a Montana dominated by wealthy individuals.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Montana requires a balance between environmental and development perspectives.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Without a natural resource economy, Montana risks becoming uninhabitable for average working-class residents.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Radical environmental groups have shut down key industries including mining, timber, oil, gas, and coal.",
